# Zero bucket encoders where they stand: payloads' bucket_driver, /bucket/zero_encoder.
#
# The driver first takes the bucket from autonomy, as a gamepad stick would, so no
# controller is holding a setpoint while the reference moves. Hand it back with
# /bucket/rearm afterwards.
#
# target is a bank - lift, tilt, jaw - sent as the bank's SET_ZERO_POS, which zeros
# both of its encoders. Success means the frame went out, not that the board acted on it:
# watch the angle to see that it now reads 0.
string target
---
bool success
string message
